Package: ArchetypeShift
Type: Package
Title: Archetype Analysis, Annotation, and Comparison for Single-Cell RNA-Seq
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Adam", "Wilson", email = "adam-wilson@ou.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools for fitting, annotating, and comparing transcriptional archetype programs in single-cell RNA-seq data. ArchetypeShift supports Seurat-based workflows for input validation, gene-universe definition, highly variable gene selection, ParetoTI/PCHA model fitting, extraction of per-cell archetype weights, correlation-based gene signature discovery, IPA-based pathway and upstream regulator annotation, replicate-aware occupancy summaries, condition contrasts, and downstream visualization.
